{"code":0,"data":{"job_post_detail":{"id":"7657124716835096882","title":"电源工程师-2027校招","description":"1、负责相机类产品电源、充电、电量计等器件的选型评估、芯片定制、方案预研及导入工作；\n2、项目基带电源、充电模块的原理图方案设计、堆叠及PCB评审；电源硬件设计及测试规范优化；\n3、解决项目中的电源类问题，如充电异常、电源功耗与热耦合、电压瞬态跌落、EMI干扰、电量异常等，输出解决方案并闭环；\n4、部门需要求的其他团队技术能力建设工作。","requirement":"1、本科及以上学历，电子信息类、电力电子相关专业。\n2、扎实的模电 / 数电、开关电源基础，掌握DCDC/LDO/ChargePump/ 有线\u0026无线充电拓扑原理，了解消费电子常见电源系统架构（低压、直流方向）；\n3、对快充、电源、电池技术有较强兴趣，逻辑清晰，动手能力强；\n4、优秀的责任心与团队协作能力，具备良好的上进心与学习能力，心态积极开放。","recruit_type":{"id":"201","name":"正式","en_name":"Regular","i18n_name":"正式","depth":2,"parent":{"id":"2","name":"校招","en_name":"Campus","i18n_name":"校招","depth":1,"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"publish_time":1782813597940,"channel_online_status":1,"job_id":"7657124716834949426","city_list":[{"code":"CT_128","name":"深圳","en_name":"Shenzhen","location_type":3,"i18n_name":"深圳","py_name":"shenzhen","mdm_code":"MDCY00000249","node_status":1}],"job_post_info":{"recruitment_type":{"id":"201","name":"正式","en_name":"Regular","i18n_name":"正式","depth":2,"parent":{"id":"2","name":"校招","en_name":"Campus","i18n_name":"校招","depth":1,"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"children":[],"active_status":1,"selectability":1},"HighlightList":[],"JobChannelPublishList":[],"job_post_object_value_map":{},"address_list":[],"city_list":[],"correlation_job_list":[],"tag_list":[],"storefront_list":[],"target_major_list":[],"job_post_process_time_list":[],"job_level_id_list":[]},"city_info_list_for_delivery":[{"code":"CT_128","name":"深圳","en_name":"Shenzhen","location_type":3,"i18n_name":"深圳","py_name":"shenzhen","mdm_code":"MDCY00000249","node_status":1}],"tag_list":[],"storefront_mode":1,"storefront_list":[],"process_type":2},"recommend_job_post_List":[]},"message":"ok","error":null}